  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the beef and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the beef from the pot and set aside.",
    "Add the onion, carrots, and celery to the pot and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the flour and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Gradually add the stout and broth, whisking constantly.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then add the beef back to the pot.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 hour.",
    "Stir in the cream and kombu seaweed.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with parsley and a dollop of yogurt.",
    "Garnish with kale and serve with a side of crusty bread.",
    "Stir in the yogurt before serving for a creamy and tangy sauce.",
    "Add more cream if desired to achieve the desired consistency."
  ],
